      <Value><![CDATA[Osborne House on the Isle of Wight was the seaside retreat of Queen Victoria and Prince Albert, who rebuilt it in the Italianate style from 1845. The state apartments and intimate family rooms are preserved much as the royal family left them.]]></Value>
